			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 230360601,
					"content": "很不錯，接下來我就要下竿了，這次一定能釣上大魚！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230360602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱萬"
				},
				{
					"id": 230360602,
					"content": "凱萬製作了魚餌，開始垂釣…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230360603
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230360603,
					"content": "不久後，凱萬釣到了一個濕漉漉的盒子…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230360604
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230360604,
					"content": "這個…我來看看…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230360605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "荷貝特"
				},
				{
					"id": 230360605,
					"content": "咦？裡面的東西…好像又是失物之類的東西呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230360606,
						230360607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "荷貝特"
				},
				{
					"id": 230360606,
					"content": "不愧是你。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230360608
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230360608,
					"content": "唔…自從上次陪著凱萬先生去找那位學者改進魚餌後，我們一直在外垂釣…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230360609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "荷貝特"
				},
				{
					"id": 230360609,
					"content": "但每次垂釣…凱萬先生還是一直釣起奇奇怪怪的東西。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230360610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "荷貝特"
				},
				{
					"id": 230360610,
					"content": "其中包括人的失物、河底的礦石、掉下船的包裹…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230360611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "荷貝特"
				},
				{
					"id": 230360611,
					"content": "甚至還有一個不慎落水的冒險家抓著凱萬先生的釣線爬上了岸…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230360612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "荷貝特"
				},
				{
					"id": 230360612,
					"content": "但是，我們就是無法釣起任何一條魚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230360613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "荷貝特"
				},
				{
					"id": 230360613,
					"content": "我的釣魚生涯，已經徹底走到盡頭了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230360614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱萬"
				},
				{
					"id": 230360614,
					"content": "凱，凱萬先生！不要這麼沮喪呀，你…你看，這東西的失主肯定很著急。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230360615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "荷貝特"
				},
				{
					"id": 230360615,
					"content": "你能把這失物釣上來，他一定會很高興的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230360616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "荷貝特"
				},
				{
					"id": 230360616,
					"content": "我們把這些失物拿回去給冒險家協會，說不定還能拿到點報酬呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230360617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "荷貝特"
				},
				{
